```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:

March 18, 2021
SUBJECT:
Professional Services Agreement between the City of Cheyenne and Federated
Hermes, for providing Investment Advisory Services
______________________________________________
Nine (9) responsive Proposals were submitted under Request for Proposal (RFP) #8-20, for
providing Investment Advisory Services.

The following firms submitted responsive Proposals:
1. Atlanta Capital Management
2. Dana Investment Advisors
3. Federated Hermes
4. Garcia Hamilton & Associates
5. LM Capital
6. Moreton Asset Management
7. PFM Asset Management
8. Public Trust Advisors
9. RBC Global Asset Management

The Investment Advisory Committee reviewed all submitted proposals and performance data, and
selected LM Capital, and Federated Hermes to conduct virtual interviews & presentations.

Upon review of proposals and as a result of the subsequent interviews, the Investment Advisory
Committee has recommended acceptance of the proposal submitted by Federated Hermes to
provide Investment Advisory Services.
```

